{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/8c1c5755dabda8673b728e4453eff6e6.poster.avif?t=1774177667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/8c1c5755dabda8673b728e4453eff6e6.webm?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/8c1c5755dabda8673b728e4453eff6e6.mp4?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Night At The Mall</i> is a first-person, narrative-driven psychological horror game where you take the night shift inside an abandoned shopping mall that refuses to stay still.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>SURVIVE THE NIGHT SHIFT</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped. The lights are flickering, the doors are locked, and the static mannequins seem to be getting closer. In this narrative-driven horror game, you must restore power and find a way out before the mall claims you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactile Investigation System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues aren't just UI text. Pick up, rotate, and inspect 3D objects in detail to find hidden keys, codes, or lore. Every item tells a story, and some hold the secrets to your survival.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/b6856fd326bed7814b3fd32faa87f2ca.poster.avif?t=1774177667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/b6856fd326bed7814b3fd32faa87f2ca.webm?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/b6856fd326bed7814b3fd32faa87f2ca.mp4?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mall is falling apart. You'll need to locate specific tools\u2014like a wrench to unbolt rusted shutters\u2014and manage complex electrical systems. Restore power by balancing auxiliary switches and main breakers to progress through the dark.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/5540a818dbd9897557d5669445ca0caf.poster.avif?t=1774177667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/5540a818dbd9897557d5669445ca0caf.webm?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/5540a818dbd9897557d5669445ca0caf.mp4?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCTV Surveillance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't be everywhere at once. Utilize a functioning Security Camera System to scout ahead. Watch the monitors in the security room to track changes in the environment or spot threats lurking in the dark hallways before you step into them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/f7dc0137d6e0fcae50ddd72c4fa24171.poster.avif?t=1774177667\" aria-label=\"Security Room\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/f7dc0137d6e0fcae50ddd72c4fa24171.webm?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/f7dc0137d6e0fcae50ddd72c4fa24171.mp4?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Unseen Threat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranoia is your enemy. The entities in this mall follow their own rules. Experience dynamic scares where mannequins change positions when your back is turned or when you look away. Keep your eyes open; looking away might be your last mistake.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/516ca80a776c8c3d37a99ff5a61f6978.poster.avif?t=1774177667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/516ca80a776c8c3d37a99ff5a61f6978.webm?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/516ca80a776c8c3d37a99ff5a61f6978.mp4?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a terrifyingly realistic environment. Experience spatial 3D audio, dynamic light failures, flickering power surges, and sanity-bending visual effects that react to your presence.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/c598564fb9148d08ee4675975dcd6a55.poster.avif?t=1774177667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/c598564fb9148d08ee4675975dcd6a55.webm?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/c598564fb9148d08ee4675975dcd6a55.mp4?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play comfortably with mouse &amp; keyboard or experience the horror with full gamepad support, featuring smooth menu navigation and intuitive interaction mechanics.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685680?t=1774177667","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/978cad2802749556f3251e5d2d536e1c7666a939/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774177667","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/38ec8312ac7da181e0ab85ec78a85c79075719c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774177667","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/38ec8312ac7da181e0ab85ec78a85c79075719c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774177667","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4265240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/8c1c5755dabda8673b728e4453eff6e6.poster.avif?t=1774177667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/8c1c5755dabda8673b728e4453eff6e6.webm?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685680/extras/8c1c5755dabda8673b728e4453eff6e6.mp4?t=1774177667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Night At The Mall</i> is a first-person, narrative-driven psychological horror game where you take the night shift inside an abandoned shopping mall that refuses to stay still.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><stro